# =====================================================================
# .gitignore for curso-power-v2026.2
#
# Keep in the repo:
#   - All handout .qmd source files + Part 0 primer + Exercise 1
#   - All rendered handout HTMLs (self-contained, embed-resources: true,
#     so they need no _files/ sidecar)
#   - The slides/ folder (PowerPoint + PDFs of the conceptual decks)
#   - data/, img/, README.md, _simulations_final.Rproj
#
# Ignore everything else.
# =====================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quarto render artefacts (from any leftover slide-deck render)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*_files/
.quarto/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Helper scripts and folders that are not for participants
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
render_all.sh
_archive/
scripts/demos/
scripts/visualizations/
output/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exercise 1 solutions (not yet shared with students)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Remove these two lines when you are ready to publish the worked answers.
scripts/Exercise_1_Power_Simulation_Between_Subjects_solutions.qmd
scripts/Exercise_1_Power_Simulation_Between_Subjects_solutions.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# RStudio / IDE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS / Linux / editor junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Office lock files (appear while a .pptx/.docx/.xlsx is open)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*
